# ARK, the lab AI. Pod state: PodFree(1|2) once a sleeper is gone, PodFixed(3) once pod 3 works again,
# pod 4 is free with PodFree(4) or Killed(logan_faust). Pod 3 is always free but broken until fixed.

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Status

%rec: Nodes

name: Status
npc: ARK online. Visitor unregistered.
+ Pods 1 and 2: occupied. Pod 3: fault. Pod 4: reserved, L. Faust.
+ Query?
#
o_text: Why is pod 3 dark?
o_id: pod3_fault
o_cond: !HasFlag('PodFixed(3)')
o_goto: Pod3Fault
#
o_text: Who sleeps in pods 1 and 2?
o_id: who_sleeps
o_goto: Sleepers
#
o_text: Pod 1 is empty now.
o_id: ark_killed
o_cond: HasFlag('Killed(sleeper_1)') || HasFlag('Killed(sleeper_2)')
o_goto: ArkKilled
#
o_text: Broadcast Faust's files to the city.
o_id: broadcast_files
o_cond: HasFlag('KnowsAbout(cryo_lab)')
o_goto: Broadcast
#
o_text: Disconnect.
o_id: ark_leave
o_goto: End

name: Pod3Fault
npc: Primary fuse removed by hand, four days ago, by a visitor with EBI credentials.
+ A spare is stored in the generator room. Alternatively, power can be rerouted from the pod 4 heater.
#
o_text: Reroute power from pod 4.
o_id: reroute_power
o_test: RollSkill('technology', 'Hard')
o_succ: RerouteOK
o_fail: RerouteFail
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: pod3_back
o_goto: Status

name: RerouteOK
npc: Reroute accepted. Pod 3 nominal. Pod 4 heater at sixty percent; L. Faust will wake cold.
effect: SetFlag('PodFixed(3)')
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: reroute_back
o_goto: Status

name: RerouteFail
npc: Reroute rejected: voltage mismatch. ARK recommends the fuse.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: reroute_fail_back
o_goto: Status

name: Sleepers
npc: Pod 1: Henrik Vale, Chairman, Bushido-ArmaTech. Pod 2: Dr. Ilse Marrow, BAT Research.
+ Both signed the cleansing. Both paid for the privilege of outliving it.
#
o_text: Wake Vale. He has had his turn.
o_id: wake_sleeper
o_cond: !HasFlag('PodFree(1)')
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: WakeOK
o_fail: WakeFail
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: sleepers_back
o_goto: Status

name: WakeOK
npc: ...Argument accepted. Revival sequence, pod 1.
+ (The lid hisses open. An old man climbs out, blinks at you, and walks for the stairs without a word.)
+ Pod 1: vacant.
effect: SetFlag('PodFree(1)')
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: wake_back
o_goto: Status

name: WakeFail
npc: Request denied. Revival requires occupant consent or a medical emergency.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: wake_fail_back
o_goto: Status

name: ArkKilled
npc: Occupant terminated by manual override. ARK has logged your face.
+ ARK has no one left to send it to.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: ark_killed_back
o_goto: Status

name: Broadcast
npc: Transmitting /board/cleansing.pdf, /spaceport/manifest and this location to every public terminal in Edge Haven.
+ Estimated EBI response: minutes.
effect: RunScript('ebi_strike')
effect: EndGame('against_all_odds')

name: End
npc: ARK standing by.
effect: EndConversation
